    ["<Assistant_Title1>【终末猎杀】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>终末猎杀</>是发生在<Assistant_Property1>猎龙之城</>的野外<Assistant_Red>500人混战</>玩法。你可以击败超凡生物或敌对玩家，获得<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>与段位胜点。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>将<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>提交给<Assistant_System>猎杀管家</>，推进猎杀进度并解锁阶段奖励。猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效，离开后将自动失效并清除。\n<Assistant_Title2>猎杀时刻：</>玩法全天开放；每日<Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</>为猎杀时刻，周六、周日额外开放<Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>。猎杀时刻期间，击杀或被击杀时涉及的段位胜点数量翻倍。\n<Assistant_Title2>王城事件：</>每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启10分钟后，即<Assistant_Red>19:10</>，王城中心刷新巨龙·投影；除周五晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始10分钟后刷新王城守卫者。\n<Assistant_Title2>团队结算：</>击杀者及最多29名符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与奖励结算。猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配，余数优先分配给击杀者1个，其余在其他参与者中随机分配。\n<Assistant_Title2>掠夺规则：</>玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高500个，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<Assistant_Title2>段位规则：</>段位低于<Assistant_Red>伯爵1阶</>时，被击杀不会损失段位胜点。每日01:00—08:00及短时间内重复击杀同一目标时，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点将按规则衰减。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往终末猎杀]|1250342}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Final Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Final Hunt</> is a <Assistant_Property1>City of Dragon Hunting</> open-world <Assistant_Red>500-player melee</> mode. You can defeat supernatural creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</> Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunt progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting; they will automatically expire and be cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</> The mode is open all day; daily <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> is Hunting Time, with additional sessions on Saturday and Sunday from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the number of Rank Points involved in kills or deaths is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</> 10 minutes after the start of the Friday night Hunting Time, i.e., at <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, a Dragon - Projection will spawn in the center of the Royal City; outside of the Friday night session, a Royal City Guardian will spawn 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</> The killer and up to 29 team members who meet the assist criteria participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among participants, with the remainder given to the killer first, and the rest distributed randomly among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</> The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 fragments increased, the plunder percentage increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</> When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Count Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points upon being killed. Rank Points gained from killing players will decay according to the rules between 01:00—08:00 daily and when killing the same target repeatedly within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Final Hunt]|1250342}",
